[Audit] BenchmarkStart: name=tether.dl, benchDir=synthesis-benchmark/tether
[Audit] InputSpecFiles: schema=synthesis-benchmark/tether/schema.dl, rules=synthesis-benchmark/tether/rules.dl, properties=synthesis-benchmark/tether/properties.dl
[Audit] ForbidConfig: global=<none>, perBenchmark=synthesis-benchmark/tether/forbid.json
[Audit] LeakageCheck: synthesizer consumes specification + BMC counterexamples only; it does not load synthesized outputs as supervision labels.
